  "description": "Modal 008 analog synthesizer (keyboard): every controller of its manual's MIDI CC implementation chart, with the values it prints.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "MODAL 008 User Manual v1.03",
      "notes": "MIDI CC implementation chart (pages 46, 47, 48 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/modal/import-modal.mjs from MODAL008_MANUAL_v1-03.pdf (sha256 fa8cb9644f4c3b0fffbe0e8ba8498932d65f0ddde4b9a13c3d08d27cb570594d), https://modalelectronics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/MODAL008_MANUAL_v1-03.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/modal/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/modal/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI CC implementation chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart prints each controller's values: a range is the parameter's, bands and named values a choice (a band's first value sent), anything else 0 - 127 with the printed text in the description.",
    "Left out, the wheel, the pedals, the joystick, bank select, the NRPN controllers and the channel mode messages: CC 1 Mod Wheel, CC 6 NRPN MSB, CC 38 NRPN LSB, CC 64 Sustain, CC 98 NRPN - Parameter, CC 99 NRPN - Bank.",
    "Numbers the chart marks unused (`-`) or leaves blank: 11, 12, 20, 32, 33, 34, 35, 39, 40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45, 46, 49, 56, 57, 58, 60, 61, 62, 63, 65, 66, 67, 68, 69, 70, 71, 72, 73, 75, 76, 77, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93, 97, 105, 108, 109, 110, 111, 112, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 121, 122, 123, 124, 125, 126, 127."
  ],
